Instancium Hub License

This repository ("https://github.com/instancium/hub") is a public trust anchor and 
distribution hub for Instancium.
Because it contains different categories of artifacts, licensing is scoped by directory
and file type.

1. Trust Anchors and Verification Metadata (/keys, *.manifest.json, *.sig)

All public keys (*.pub), certificates (*.cert), manifests (*.manifest.json), detached
signatures (*.sig), and verification instructions in README.md may be freely copied,
cached, mirrored, and used by any client or third party for cryptographic verification
purposes without restriction.

2. Official Documents (/docs)

Copyright (c) 2026 Instancium. All Rights Reserved.

Official documents published under /docs (including the Instancium Doctrine) may be
downloaded, stored, and redistributed ONLY in their exact, unmodified form together
with their accompanying *.manifest.json and *.sig files. Modification, translation,
or creation of derivative works is not permitted without prior written consent.

3. Drivers and Third-Party Binaries (/drivers and GitHub Release Assets)

Driver packages and third-party runtime components distributed via GitHub Release Assets
remain the property of their respective copyright holders and are governed by their
original upstream licenses. Applicable upstream licenses and component metadata are
maintained under /drivers (and included within each release package).

4. Disclaimer of Warranty

ALL FILES, KEYS, AND ARTIFACTS IN THIS REPOSITORY ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT
WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES
OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT
SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES, OR OTHER
LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT, OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF,
OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE USE OF THIS REPOSITORY.